```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[attempt operation] --> R{success?}
  R -->|yes| S[return result]
  R -->|no| T{known transient error?}
  T -->|no| F[raise immediately]
  T -->|yes| L{attempts remain?}
  L -->|no| F
  L -->|yes| I{safe to repeat?}
  I -->|no| F
  I -->|yes| W[wait with backoff and jitter]
  W --> A
```
